{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your very own comic book store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a comic book store owner and transform your humble store to a bookworm's haven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy comic licenses, hire staff, and engage in various events such as book signings and collect rare version of comics and sell it at a premium! Use various tools to protect your store from troublemakers and keep your store clean! And explore the surrounding areas inspired by the Japanese backstreets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/English_Comic_Book_Store.png?t=1748445204\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/Comic_Book_Store.gif?t=1748445204\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run and manage your own comic book store!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/English_300+_Comics.png?t=1748445204\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/Over_300_Comics.gif?t=1748445204\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>License and Collect over 300+ Comics from over 75+ Series that parodies popular comics in real life!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/English_Stories.png?t=1748445204\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354220/extras/Story.gif?t=1748445204\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover the wacky and lighthearted stories from people around the neighbourhood!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragra